 "summary": "Nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SMB (DO-214AA) surface-mount package, all rated 2 A average forward current and 50 A for one 8.3 ms half-sine surge. They differ in reverse voltage, from 20 V (SS22B) to 200 V (SS220B); the higher-voltage types have a larger forward drop and less leakage. Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and polarity protection. SS220B is the 200 V type.",
